{"3958550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wilva", "steam_appid": 3958550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wilba quit his job as a soldier in the kingdom and returned to his hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, the Demon King ordered his forces to launch surprise attacks and plunder the surrounding villages. The Demon King's army stormed Wilba's house and stole the Super Hoe, a family heirloom passed down for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, Wilba set out on a journey to the Demon King's castle to reclaim the stolen Super Hoe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses by clearing one stage to advance to the next. Defeat the boss waiting at the end of each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use two attack methods: sword swings and javelin throws. Jump to dodge enemy attacks and eliminate foes hindering Wilba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Demon King's forces across all 4 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points and money. Accumulate enough experience to level up and make Wilba stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, use your money to purchase necessary items from the village shop to prepare for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and use recovery potions to restore HP and food items that temporarily boost stats while in the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover useful items in the chests scattered throughout.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wilba quit his job as a soldier in the kingdom and returned to his hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, the Demon King ordered his forces to launch surprise attacks and plunder the surrounding villages. The Demon King's army stormed Wilba's house and stole the Super Hoe, a family heirloom passed down for generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, Wilba set out on a journey to the Demon King's castle to reclaim the stolen Super Hoe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses by clearing one stage to advance to the next. Defeat the boss waiting at the end of each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use two attack methods: sword swings and javelin throws. Jump to dodge enemy attacks and eliminate foes hindering Wilba.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the Demon King's forces across all 4 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points and money. Accumulate enough experience to level up and make Wilba stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, use your money to purchase necessary items from the village shop to prepare for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and use recovery potions to restore HP and food items that temporarily boost stats while in the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover useful items in the chests scattered throughout.</p>", "short_description": "Wilba is a side-scrolling action platformer game influenced by classic action RPG games.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958550/8d398d66ba443c7118517c2cc3bfefb0abd97c54/header.jpg?t=1768170491", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958550/38705e326221a9fc138cf339b27326a85a115ac6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768170491", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958550/38705e326221a9fc138cf339b27326a85a115ac6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768170491", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><